* =====================================================================
* DFF_TSPC : positive-edge True-Single-Phase-Clock D flip-flop
*            (Yuan-Svensson 9T core + output inverter = 11T)
*  stage1 (P-section): CLK=0 -> x = D'        CLK=1 -> x can only fall
*  stage2 (precharge): CLK=0 -> y = 1         CLK=1 -> y = x'
*  stage3 (evaluate) : CLK=1 -> qb = y'       CLK=0 -> hold
*  q = qb'   (static output buffer, size so)
* =====================================================================
.subckt DFF_TSPC d clk q so=2
* stage 1
XP1 n1 d   vdd PM w={2*BETA*UN}
XP2 x  clk n1  PM w={2*BETA*UN}
XN3 x  d   0   NM w={UN}
* stage 2
XP4 y  clk vdd PM w={BETA*UN}
XN5 y  x   n2  NM w={2*UN}
XN6 n2 clk 0   NM w={2*UN}
* stage 3
XP7 qb y   vdd PM w={BETA*UN}
XN8 qb clk n3  NM w={2*UN}
XN9 n3 y   0   NM w={2*UN}
* output buffer
XO  qb q INV s={so}
.ends DFF_TSPC
